# Prisma

- **Do not edit** anything under `src/prisma/generated/`. That folder is generated by `prisma generate` from `prisma/schema.prisma` and will be overwritten.
- To change the data model or client API, edit `prisma/schema.prisma` and run `npx prisma generate` (and add migrations as needed).
- When working in `src/prisma/`, only modify hand-written files (e.g. `prisma.service.ts`, `prisma.module.ts`, `prisma.unit-of-work.ts`, `prisma-db.util.ts`). Import from `./generated/` or `@prisma/client` as appropriate; do not change generated files.
